# Helm templates are Go-templated YAML, not parseable YAML.
charts/*/templates/

# Claude skills carry a table generated by scripts/gen-claude-skills.py, and
# prettier rewrites the `*` that marks an optional field into `_`, which is a
# different character with a different meaning. Formatting them would corrupt
# the table and then fight the generator on the next run.
.claude/skills/
